                    <img src="/assets/images/activities/2026-09-10-3.jpg" alt="Grilling at the park" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                    <img src="/assets/images/activities/2026-09-10-4.jpg" alt="Team enjoying the BBQ" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
