                            He also showcased three applications:
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Quantifying gene- and age-related arterial stiffening</li>
                            <li>Identifying material properties of aortic aneurysms in Vivo</li>
                            <li>Modeling aortic tissue growth</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </details>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cs-activity cs-news-item">
            <div class="cs-media">
                <img
                  src="/assets/images/activities/activities3.png"
                  alt="Team demo or lab activity photo"
                  loading="lazy"
                  decoding="async"
                />
            </div>
            <div class="cs-body">
                <div class="cs-meta">
                    <time class="cs-date" datetime="2025-10-03">Oct 3, 2025</time>
                    <span class="cs-tag">Networking</span>
                </div>
                <h2 class="cs-activity-title">Y Computing System Lab Meet-and-Greet</h2>
