                </div>
                <h2 class="cs-activity-title">Scholar Visit: Hannah (Columbia University)</h2>
                <p class="cs-desc">
                    We welcomed Hannah, a 3rd-year PhD student from Columbia University, to our lab!
                    She worked on uniaxial heart stretching experiments and got hands-on experience in cardiac biomechanics research.
                </p>
                <details class="cs-details">
                    <summary>Read more</summary>
                    <div class="cs-details-content">
