                <p class="cs-desc">
                    Dr. Shi was interviewed by the university for the second time, discussing his work on gastrointestinal research.
                    The interview focused on how he leverages his engineering background to develop solutions for stomach diseases, highlighting the innovative, interdisciplinary approach of his lab.
