                <p class="cs-desc">
                    Dr. Shi and his PhD student Yue Li represented our lab at the ASME SB3C Summer Bioengineering Conference (SBC 2025).
                    During the conference, Yue Li received the Culture and Community Travel Award for the 2025 ASME SBC in recognition of her contributions.
                </p>
